{"index":2152,"node_id":"19bd26bf-433d-4b70-b1ef-7c41f729c5b3","parent":"d5da733a-382a-43f5-8487-28e430b3734b","role":"assistant","author_name":null,"create_time":1791098735.006674,"update_time":1791098762.941992,"content_type":"text","status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"recipient":"all","model_slug":"gpt-5-6-thinking","default_model_slug":"gpt-5-6-thinking","part":1,"parts_total":1,"text":"Use this as the **replacement end-of-challenge verification rule block**:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"end_of_challenge_verification\": {\n    \"execution_order\": [\n      \"finish_all_batches\",\n      \"encrypt_batches_before_git\",\n      \"publish_processing_branch\",\n      \"open_verification_pull_request\",\n      \"run_verifier\",\n      \"record_verdict\",\n      \"close_pull_request\",\n      \"delete_processing_branch\"\n    ],\n    \"plaintext_rule\": {\n      \"allowed_location\": \"ephemeral local or GitHub Actions runner filesystem only\",\n      \"github_plaintext_allowed\": false,\n      \"plaintext_commit_allowed\": false,\n      \"plaintext_pull_request_allowed\": false,\n      \"rule\": \"No unencrypted challenge output, intermediate batch, combined result, or verifier input may ever be committed or uploaded to GitHub. Plaintext may exist only temporarily in the executing environment.\"\n    },\n    \"batch_rule\": {\n      \"batching_allowed\": true,\n      \"plaintext_batches_may_exist_locally\": true,\n      \"before_any_git_write\": \"encrypt the completed batch using the configured challenge archive password\",\n      \"github_batch_format\": \"password-encrypted archive only\",\n      \"delete_local_plaintext_after_encryption\": true,\n      \"preserve_batch_order\": true\n    },\n    \"password_rule\": {\n      \"source\": \"user-configured GitHub Actions secret\",\n      \"producer_model_generates_password\": false,\n      \"password_may_be_committed\": false,\n      \"password_may_be_written_to_pull_request\": false,\n      \"password_may_be_written_to_logs\": false,\n      \"producer_workflow_use\": \"encrypt challenge batch archives\",\n      \"verifier_workflow_use\": \"decrypt challenge batch archives in the verifier runner\"\n    },\n    \"processing_branch\": {\n      \"purpose\": \"temporary transport of encrypted challenge results to verification\",\n      \"contents_allowed\": [\n        \"encrypted batch archives\",\n        \"non-secret verification metadata required to identify the challenge\"\n      ],\n      \"contents_forbidden\": [\n        \"plaintext challenge results\",\n        \"plaintext batches\",\n        \"archive password\",\n        \"decrypted verifier input\"\n      ],\n      \"merge_into_main\": false\n    },\n    \"verification_pull_request\": {\n      \"head\": \"processing branch\",\n      \"purpose\": \"trigger end-of-challenge verification\",\n      \"must_not_merge\": true,\n      \"on_open\": \"activate verifier workflow\"\n    },\n    \"verifier\": {\n      \"input_source\": \"encrypted archives committed to the processing branch\",\n      \"decrypt_location\": \"ephemeral verifier runner filesystem\",\n      \"password_source\": \"same configured GitHub Actions secret used by the encryption workflow\",\n      \"required_context_delivery\": \"workflow decrypts and loads the required challenge evidence before invoking the verifier model; the verifier model is not responsible for deciding whether to retrieve the evidence\",\n      \"verification_basis\": \"live ground truth and deterministic evidence where applicable, not producer assertions\",\n      \"allowed_verdicts\": [\n        \"PASS\",\n        \"FAIL\"\n      ],\n      \"pass_rule\": \"PASS only when every required end-of-challenge verification succeeds\",\n      \"fail_rule\": \"FAIL if any required verification fails, is missing, cannot be established, or contradicts live ground truth\"\n    },\n    \"cleanup\": {\n      \"after_verdict\": [\n        \"record PASS or FAIL\",\n        \"delete decrypted verifier plaintext from the runner\",\n        \"close the verification pull request without merging\",\n        \"delete the processing branch\"\n      ],\n      \"branch_deletion_is_not_primary_secrecy_control\": true,\n      \"primary_secrecy_control\": \"plaintext was never committed to GitHub\"\n    },\n    \"completion_gate\": {\n      \"challenge_complete_only_if\": [\n        \"all required batches were produced\",\n        \"only encrypted challenge output reached GitHub\",\n        \"verification pull request was opened\",\n        \"verifier executed against the decrypted challenge evidence\",\n        \"verifier returned PASS\",\n        \"pull request was closed without merge\",\n        \"processing branch was deleted\"\n      ],\n      \"otherwise\": \"challenge is not successfully complete\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe central invariant is now: **GitHub never receives plaintext; the verifier gets plaintext only after workflow-controlled decryption; PASS is the end gate; the PR is never merged; the temporary processing branch is deleted afterward.**"}
